==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 300¢ or more

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 5.33~16 seconds<sup>160f~480f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 2.67 seconds<sup>80f</sup>, delay 8~24 seconds<sup>240f~720f</sup>.
*9 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 17.33 seconds<sup>520f</sup>, delay 10.67~14 seconds<sup>320f~420f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
**5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen]] (or [[Nono (Rare Cat)|Nono]]/[[Li'l Gau (Rare Cat)|Li'l Gau]] if you have them) and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg]] Cats to win, preferably with the aid of some [[Cat Combo]]s.

